{
    "title": "InStories: Insta Stories Maker",
    "description": "<b>Instories for Stories</b>\r\nInstories is an application designed for bloggers and SMM professionals to help them create impressive designs on social media quickly and without special skills. \r\nThis application contains animation templates that are made by professionals and can be easily edited and processed according to the necessary requirements by adding photos and videos. The programme is available on Google Play and free of charge. Stable operation of Instories is ensured even on gadgets with an average configuration.\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b>\r\nInstories meet all user needs. The user-friendly interface allows you to quickly edit photos and videos and embody your dynamic creative design ideas both for personal and commercial purposes.\r\n\r\n<b>Templates</b>\r\nThe programme includes ready-made templates in different style solutions for stories and posts in Instagram, Snapchat, TikTok, Facebook, and VK. You can choose a collage that matches the theme of the user\u2019s account on Insta and other social media and then fill it with suitable content. There are many different collections of animated stickers available. It is possible to change the background color, choose a dynamic background from the Instories library, or put your own file on the background.\r\n\r\n<b>Convenient Photo and Video Editor</b>\r\nA convenient editor will help you create stories on Instagram and other social media by using personal photos and videos. Video processing is extremely simple:\r\n\ud83d\udccc load media files into ready-made templates;\r\n\ud83d\udccc add the animation text effects and music you need;\r\n\ud83d\udccc do your post. \r\nYou can edit Stories in any format.\r\n\r\n<b>Story and Post Formats</b>\r\nInstories provides standard (16:9), square (1:1), post (4:5) and Reels format specifically for Insta. The editor options will help you style your social media feed in neon color or enhance the page with a different style, as if it were done by a professional.\r\n\r\n<b>Animated Fonts</b>\r\nThe application has a variety of animated effects and fonts for any purpose. You can download other fonts as well. Animated captions will help you style any video or photo story at a professional level.\r\n\r\n<b>Music Editor</b>\r\nThe Instories app allows you to add music to videos, making your posts full music video. The music collection of the application is very extensive. Music is also added from a playlist stored in the smartphone\u2019s memory.\r\n\r\n<b>Personal Processing</b>\r\nReady-made templates can be changed and edited at your own discretion, thus creating unique content on Instagram and other social media. The user just needs to select a collage and change its format, taking into account the theme of the account.\r\n\r\n<b>Simple Interface</b>\r\nThe application has an intuitive interface with flexible settings. To create an effective personal or commercial story, you do not need to study complex programmes, the functionality of graphic and video editors. You select ready-made covers using a convenient filter and can be and you can change them easily to suit the topic of your post.\r\n\r\n<b>Access for All</b>\r\nTo create your story, you do not need to register or create an account. Installation of the application on your smartphone allows you to make striking posts in just a few minutes.\r\nInstories is available on IOS and Android. All tools and filters work for the first 3 days. At the end of the trial period, the free version retains the Minimal template, basic animations, and the option to add stickers, music, and change the background. To use the full functionality of the programme, you should activate the PRO version.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Instories for Stories</b><br>Instories is an application designed for bloggers and SMM professionals to help them create impressive designs on social media quickly and without special skills. <br>This application contains animation templates that are made by professionals and can be easily edited and processed according to the necessary requirements by adding photos and videos. The programme is available on Google Play and free of charge. Stable operation of Instories is ensured even on gadgets with an average configuration.<br><br><b>Features</b><br>Instories meet all user needs. The user-friendly interface allows you to quickly edit photos and videos and embody your dynamic creative design ideas both for personal and commercial purposes.<br><br><b>Templates</b><br>The programme includes ready-made templates in different style solutions for stories and posts in Instagram, Snapchat, TikTok, Facebook, and VK. You can choose a collage that matches the theme of the user\u2019s account on Insta and other social media and then fill it with suitable content. There are many different collections of animated stickers available. It is possible to change the background color, choose a dynamic background from the Instories library, or put your own file on the background.<br><br><b>Convenient Photo and Video Editor</b><br>A convenient editor will help you create stories on Instagram and other social media by using personal photos and videos. Video processing is extremely simple:<br>\ud83d\udccc load media files into ready-made templates;<br>\ud83d\udccc add the animation text effects and music you need;<br>\ud83d\udccc do your post. <br>You can edit Stories in any format.<br><br><b>Story and Post Formats</b><br>Instories provides standard (16:9), square (1:1), post (4:5) and Reels format specifically for Insta. The editor options will help you style your social media feed in neon color or enhance the page with a different style, as if it were done by a professional.<br><br><b>Animated Fonts</b><br>The application has a variety of animated effects and fonts for any purpose. You can download other fonts as well. Animated captions will help you style any video or photo story at a professional level.<br><br><b>Music Editor</b><br>The Instories app allows you to add music to videos, making your posts full music video. The music collection of the application is very extensive. Music is also added from a playlist stored in the smartphone\u2019s memory.<br><br><b>Personal Processing</b><br>Ready-made templates can be changed and edited at your own discretion, thus creating unique content on Instagram and other social media. The user just needs to select a collage and change its format, taking into account the theme of the account.<br><br><b>Simple Interface</b><br>The application has an intuitive interface with flexible settings. To create an effective personal or commercial story, you do not need to study complex programmes, the functionality of graphic and video editors. You select ready-made covers using a convenient filter and can be and you can change them easily to suit the topic of your post.<br><br><b>Access for All</b><br>To create your story, you do not need to register or create an account. Installation of the application on your smartphone allows you to make striking posts in just a few minutes.<br>Instories is available on IOS and Android. All tools and filters work for the first 3 days. At the end of the trial period, the free version retains the Minimal template, basic animations, and the option to add stickers, music, and change the background. To use the full functionality of the programme, you should activate the PRO version.",
